<title>INDIA: India sugar prices firm in narrow range.</title>
<headline>India sugar prices firm in narrow range.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian sugar prices held steady in a narrow price band on Wednesday despite low consumer demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>In the ready delivery sugar S/30 was quiet at 1245/1285 rupees while M/30 was steady at 1270/1325.</p>
<p>Sugar mill delivery remained steady at 1190/1200 rupees.</p>
<p>Overall sentiment was subdued at the close and traders were expecting the market to remain in a narrow price band.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
